<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>“避免 AI 去猜”四条判断纪律</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E9E62' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>已实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E2340', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>“精准定位、避免猜测”是通过步骤和作答证据追求的设计目标，是否实际降低误诊率仍需与教师标注及对照系统比较</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>一 · 不一致可指出</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生写出错误等式时，可以指出该等式与前一步不一致——这是有证据的观察。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>二 · 缺失≠不会</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生没写某一步，只能首先认定该步骤缺失；不能直接认定其不会相关知识。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三 · 另解独立判断</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生使用另一种正确解法，应独立判断其数学正确性，不能因不符合参考路径就判错。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>四 · 证据不足保留</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>证据不足时应保留判断，并通过追问或补充练习核实，而不是输出一个未经证实的错因。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §3.2</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 26 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>